#~ msgid "Units"
#~ msgstr "Юниты"

#~ msgid "Your army is built from these units. Each one has a job."
#~ msgstr "Ваша армия состоит из этих юнитов. У каждого своя задача."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Troopers fight on both attack and defense, but they are weak at each. "
#~ "They are cheap to buy and cheap to keep. They eat more food than other "
#~ "units. They help you defend against Sabre missile attacks."
#~ msgstr "Пехота"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Jets attack only. They cannot defend. One jet is about twice as strong on "
#~ "attack as a trooper. Jets are cheap to buy but cost a lot to keep. They "
#~ "need carriers to reach a battle: one carrier moves 100 jets. An enemy SDI "
#~ "shield cuts your jets' strength by about a quarter."
#~ msgstr "Истребители"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Turrets defend only. One turret is about twice as strong on defense as a "
#~ "trooper. They shoot down attacking jets, destroy tanks, and kill troops. "
#~ "They also help stop incoming missiles. Covert operations cannot destroy "
#~ "them."
#~ msgstr "Турели"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Tanks are the best all-around unit. They are strong on both attack and "
#~ "defense.  They cost a lot to buy but little to keep. A strong "
#~ "HeadQuarters and good morale make your tanks even stronger. Tanks help "
#~ "you defend against chemical attacks."
#~ msgstr "Танки"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Bombers have no attack or defense strength of their own. They carry "
#~ "payloads.  Missiles and interplanetary bombings need bombers to deliver "
#~ "them. In a regular attack, your bombers destroy the enemy jets that are "
#~ "sitting on the ground."
#~ msgstr "Бомбардировщики"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Carriers move your jets to a battle and carry goods for trade. One "
#~ "carrier moves up to 100 jets."
#~ msgstr "Авианосцы"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Agents run covert operations, such as spying and sabotage. Having many "
#~ "agents also helps defend you against enemy covert operations."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Агенты проводят тайные операции — шпионаж и диверсии. Множество агентов "
#~ "также помогает защищаться от вражеских тайных операций."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "\"Return\" (the `0` key) leaves a side menu (like the Bank or the System "
#~ "Menu) and takes you back to where you were."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "«Return» (клавиша `0`) выходит из бокового меню (например, Банк или "
#~ "Системное меню) и возвращает вас туда, где вы были."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "If you turn on \"Enter exits Buy menu\" in Preferences, pressing Enter at "
#~ "a turn menu chooses Quit for you."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Если включить «Enter выходит из меню покупок» в Настройках, нажатие Enter "
#~ "в меню хода выберет за вас «Quit»."

